            "${{s3}}{{s2}}{{s1}}{{s0}}_2$",
            "${{x3}}{{x2}}{{x1}}{{x0}}_2$",
            "${{o3}}{{o2}}{{o1}}{{o0}}_2$"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "In decimal this is ${{a}} + {{b}} = {{a+b}}$, which is ${{s3}}{{s2}}{{s1}}{{s0}}_2$. Remember to carry: in every column where both bits are 1, the sum bit is 0 and a 1 carries to the next column. Ignoring the carries gives ${{x3}}{{x2}}{{x1}}{{x0}}_2$, and OR-ing the bits gives ${{o3}}{{o2}}{{o1}}{{o0}}_2$.",
